    `the accused is proved to have had in his or her possession or custody or under his or her control a document of title relating to the thing or another document intended for its delivery` IS FALSE
    `the accused proves that he or she did not have the thing in his or her possession` IS FALSE
    `the accused proves that he or she did not know the nature of the thing` IS FALSE
    `the accused proves that his or her possession of the thing was not for the purpose of trafficking` IS FALSE
    `one of 2 or more persons with the knowledge and consent of the rest has the thing in his or her possession` IS FALSE
    `the accused never had physical possession of the thing` IS FALSE

