    `a pipe, syringe, utensil, apparatus or other article intended for smoking, administration or consumption of a controlled drug or psychoactive substance is found in the place or premises` IS FALSE
    `the place or premises is proved to be used for smoking, administering or consuming a controlled drug or psychoactive substance` IS FALSE
    `the accused was found in, or escaping from, the place or premises` IS FALSE
    `the thing was found in a ship or aircraft` IS FALSE
    `the thing was found in a vehicle` IS FALSE
    `the accused is the master or the captain of the ship or aircraft` IS FALSE
    `the accused is the owner of the vehicle` IS FALSE
    `the accused is the person in charge of the vehicle for the time being` IS FALSE
    `the thing was found in the urine of the accused as a result of both urine tests conducted under section 31(4)(b)` IS TRUE
    `the contrary is proved` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `consumption is presumed under section 22` `found in the urine`

#ASSERT NOT `consumption is presumed under section 22` `found in the urine, contrary proved`

#ASSERT NOT `consumption is presumed under section 22` `person found in a place, nothing shown`

