§ `23. protection of informers`

`informer: civil or criminal, no exception` MEANS `Informer Facts` WITH
    `the proceedings are civil or criminal proceedings` IS TRUE
    `the proceedings are before a court for an offence under this Act` IS FALSE
    `the court, after full inquiry into the case, is satisfied that an informer wilfully made a material statement which he or she knew or believed to be false or did not believe to be true` IS FALSE
    `in proceedings other than for an offence under this Act, the court is of the opinion that justice cannot be fully done between the parties without the disclosure of the name of an informer` IS FALSE

`informer: trial, informer lied` MEANS `Informer Facts` WITH
    `the proceedings are civil or criminal proceedings` IS TRUE
    `the proceedings are before a court for an offence under this Act` IS TRUE
    `the court, after full inquiry into the case, is satisfied that an informer wilfully made a material statement which he or she knew or believed to be false or did not believe to be true` IS TRUE
    `in proceedings other than for an offence under this Act, the court is of the opinion that justice cannot be fully done between the parties without the disclosure of the name of an informer` IS FALSE

`informer: trial, justice argument only` MEANS `Informer Facts` WITH
    `the proceedings are civil or criminal proceedings` IS TRUE
    `the proceedings are before a court for an offence under this Act` IS TRUE
    `the court, after full inquiry into the case, is satisfied that an informer wilfully made a material statement which he or she knew or believed to be false or did not believe to be true` IS FALSE
    `in proceedings other than for an offence under this Act, the court is of the opinion that justice cannot be fully done between the parties without the disclosure of the name of an informer` IS TRUE

`informer: other proceedings, justice requires` MEANS `Informer Facts` WITH
    `the proceedings are civil or criminal proceedings` IS TRUE
    `the proceedings are before a court for an offence under this Act` IS FALSE
    `the court, after full inquiry into the case, is satisfied that an informer wilfully made a material statement which he or she knew or believed to be false or did not believe to be true` IS FALSE
    `in proceedings other than for an offence under this Act, the court is of the opinion that justice cannot be fully done between the parties without the disclosure of the name of an informer` IS TRUE

`informer: other proceedings, informer lied` MEANS `Informer Facts` WITH
    `the proceedings are civil or criminal proceedings` IS TRUE
    `the proceedings are before a court for an offence under this Act` IS FALSE
    `the court, after full inquiry into the case, is satisfied that an informer wilfully made a material statement which he or she knew or believed to be false or did not believe to be true` IS TRUE
    `in proceedings other than for an offence under this Act, the court is of the opinion that justice cannot be fully done between the parties without the disclosure of the name of an informer` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the court may permit inquiry and require full disclosure concerning the informer` `informer: trial, informer lied`

#ASSERT `the court may permit inquiry and require full disclosure concerning the informer` `informer: other proceedings, justice requires`

#ASSERT NOT `the court may permit inquiry and require full disclosure concerning the informer` `informer: civil or criminal, no exception`

#ASSERT NOT `the court may permit inquiry and require full disclosure concerning the informer` `informer: trial, justice argument only`

#ASSERT NOT `the court may permit inquiry and require full disclosure concerning the informer` `informer: other proceedings, informer lied`

#ASSERT `information for an offence under the Act is excluded from evidence by section 23(1)(a)` `informer: civil or criminal, no exception`

#ASSERT NOT `information for an offence under the Act is excluded from evidence by section 23(1)(a)` `informer: trial, informer lied`

#ASSERT `a witness may be required to disclose the name and address of the informer` `informer: trial, informer lied`

#ASSERT NOT `a witness may be required to disclose the name and address of the informer` `informer: civil or criminal, no exception`
